---
description: Rules for the @umc/shared package consumed by both web and API
globs: packages/shared/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared package (`packages/shared`)

- Contains only types, constants, and pure functions. No runtime dependencies on Node, the DOM, Express, Mongoose or React.
- Relative imports use the `.js` extension (NodeNext ESM).
- Export everything through `src/index.ts` via barrel files (`types/index.ts`, `constants/index.ts`).
- The package is consumed from its compiled `dist/`. After changing it, `npm run build:shared` (or keep `npm run dev` running, which watches it).
- Treat exported types as an API contract: changing them affects both apps, so update both in the same change.
